WEBVTT

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:02.817
Pollen is a common offender,
just because we encounter so much of it,

00:03:02.817 --> 00:03:04.845
but there's a long list of substances:

00:03:04.845 --> 00:03:05.667
dust,

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:06.682
animal dander,

00:03:06.682 --> 00:03:07.780
insect venom,

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:08.966
medications,

00:03:08.966 --> 00:03:10.096
certain foods,

00:03:10.096 --> 00:03:13.704
that can send your immune system
into overdrive.

00:03:13.704 --> 00:03:15.829
Some of these reactions can be scary.

00:03:15.829 --> 00:03:19.175
An allergy can develop
into full-blown anaphylaxis,

00:03:19.175 --> 00:03:21.492
which typically brings on severe swelling,

00:03:21.492 --> 00:03:22.775
shortness of breath,

00:03:22.775 --> 00:03:24.965
and very low blood pressure.

00:03:24.965 --> 00:03:26.636
It can be deadly.

00:03:26.636 --> 00:03:30.568
The body can even have 
an allergic reaction to itself